<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-NETHERLANDS AND NEW ZEALAND LEVEL IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NETHERLANDS AND NEW ZEALAND LEVEL IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Netherlands and</p>
<p>New Zealand were level after sharing the opening singles matches</p>
<p>in their Davis Cup World group qualifying tie on Friday,</p>
<p>Results (Dutch names first):</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink beat Brett Steven 6-7 (4-7) 7-6 (7-2) 6-3 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>Richard Krajicek lost to Alistair Hunt 6-7 (5-7) 6-3 6-4 1-4,</p>
<p>Krajicek retired injured</p>
</text>
